  "reason": "The existing evidence shows config_007 (0.639 accuracy) and config_026 (0.635 accuracy) are top performers with multimodal settings. This experiment tests using transformer aggregation (which outperformed avgpool in config_001/config_008) with scvi_n200 RNA encoder (more expressive than pca_n2000) while retaining resnet50 image encoder (proven effective in config_007). It clarifies if combining transformer aggregation with a more sophisticated RNA encoder can surpass current bests. Expected cost ~12 GPU hours (moderate for complex architecture), balancing exploration of aggregation methods with proven image encoder."
}

